release/
dist/

# MCP bundle icon is copied from public/icons at build time
mcpb/icon.png

# Tauri / Rust desktop wrapper
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Optional code signing and updater secret files
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.asc

# Exclude all markdown files except README.md from git tracking/commits
*.md
!README.md

# Changesets are release inputs, not documentation: the CI workflow reads
# .changeset/*.md to decide the next version, and `changeset version` writes the
# collected notes into CHANGELOG.md. Both have to be tracked for that to work.
!.changeset/*.md
!CHANGELOG.md
